        "body": "iOS and Android mobile releases are built from this tag and core tag `cp-25.04.7-3`\r\n\r\nThis release contains various fixes, some mobile-specific highlights are\r\n\r\n- Some various phone UI changes\r\n- We now hide the toolbars on smaller devices in landscape mode\r\n- Some improvements to how some notebook bar icons mean in tablet mode\r\n\r\nYou can find our Android release builds [on our website](https://www.collaboraoffice.com/downloads/Collabora-Office-Android-Release/) or on the [Play Store](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.collabora.libreoffice). iOS release builds are available on the [App Store](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/collabora-office/id1440482071)."
